# Transient scratch dir written by run_golden.bat during a `check`.
# The goldens (*.odin.golden) ARE tracked; this fresh-emission output is not.
#
# Unrooted, so it also matches examples_corpus/.gen/ below this directory —
# run_corpus_golden.bat's own scratch dir (4 files per fixture: .odin,
# .rerun.odin, .shim.odin, .shim.rerun.odin). Verified with
# `git check-ignore -v` before roadmap B6-2 recorded the examples_corpus
# goldens, so the top-level .gitignore does not need its own entry for that
# path — adding one would just be a second rule for the same match.
.gen/
